<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Musician, Pt. 1 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864857547"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="06:12.630"><div begin="01:50.731" end="06:12.630"><p begin="01:50.731" end="01:54.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="01:50.731" end="01:50.970">No</span> <span begin="01:50.970" end="01:51.098">I</span> <span begin="01:51.098" end="01:51.371">don’t</span> <span begin="01:51.371" end="01:51.611">miss</span> <span begin="01:51.611" end="01:51.847">the</span> <span begin="01:51.847" end="01:52.243">fee</span><span begin="01:52.243" end="01:52.550">ling</span> <span begin="01:53.248" end="01:53.483">a</span><span begin="01:53.483" end="01:53.740">ny</span><span begin="01:53.740" end="01:54.334">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不 我再也不会思念那种感觉了</span></p><p begin="01:54.735" end="01:58.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="01:54.735" end="01:54.990">Yeah</span> <span begin="01:54.990" end="01:55.109">I</span> <span begin="01:55.109" end="01:55.356">want</span> <span begin="01:55.356" end="01:55.621">some</span><span begin="01:55.621" end="01:55.873">thing</span> <span begin="01:55.873" end="01:56.479">new</span> <span begin="01:57.231" end="01:57.727">to</span> <span begin="01:57.727" end="01:58.228">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望能有新事物来让我施予爱意</span></p><p begin="01:58.228" end="02:00.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="01:58.228" end="01:58.481">I</span> <span begin="01:58.481" end="01:59.002">was</span> <span begin="01:59.002" end="01:59.481">so</span> <span begin="01:59.481" end="01:59.724">nos</span><span begin="01:59.724" end="02:00.231">tal</span><span begin="02:00.231" end="02:00.602">gic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我是如此地恋旧</span></p><p begin="02:00.602" end="02:02.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="02:00.602" end="02:00.719">But</span> <span begin="02:00.719" end="02:00.985">I’m</span> <span begin="02:00.985" end="02:01.463">fine</span> <span begin="02:01.463" end="02:01.749">wi</span><span begin="02:01.749" end="02:02.240">thout</span> <span begin="02:02.240" end="02:02.726">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但抛掉那种感觉 其实也没关系</span></p><p begin="02:02.726" end="02:06.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="02:02.726" end="02:03.002">You</span> <span begin="02:03.002" end="02:03.244">don’t</span> <span begin="02:03.244" end="02:03.501">real</span><span begin="02:03.501" end="02:03.732">ly</span> <span begin="02:03.732" end="02:04.248">want</span> <span begin="02:04.248" end="02:04.481">what</span> <span begin="02:04.481" end="02:04.726">you</span> <span begin="02:04.726" end="02:05.245">think</span> <span begin="02:05.245" end="02:05.742">you</span> <span begin="02:05.742" end="02:06.314">want</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你渴望的并非就是你真正想要的</span></p><p begin="02:06.753" end="02:10.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="02:06.753" end="02:06.989">No</span> <span begin="02:06.989" end="02:07.094">I</span> <span begin="02:07.094" end="02:07.341">don’t</span> <span begin="02:07.341" end="02:07.589">wan</span><span begin="02:07.589" end="02:07.833">na</span> <span begin="02:07.833" end="02:08.226">lose</span> <span begin="02:08.226" end="02:08.723">it</span> <span begin="02:09.247" end="02:09.496">this</span> <span begin="02:09.496" end="02:09.739">e</span><span begin="02:09.739" end="02:10.237">mo</span><span begin="02:10.237" end="02:10.494">tion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不 我不想抛弃掉这份情绪</span></p><p begin="02:10.729" end="02:14.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="02:10.729" end="02:10.973">Yeah</span> <span begin="02:10.973" end="02:11.091">I</span> <span begin="02:11.091" end="02:11.366">just</span> <span begin="02:11.366" end="02:11.607">wan</span><span begin="02:11.607" end="02:11.858">na</span> <span begin="02:11.858" end="02:12.544">do</span> <span begin="02:12.734" end="02:13.461">e</span><span begin="02:13.461" end="02:13.723">very</span><span begin="02:13.723" end="02:14.026">thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只是想体验世间所有</span></p><p begin="02:14.251" end="02:16.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="02:14.251" end="02:14.485">I</span> <span begin="02:14.485" end="02:14.984">get</span> <span begin="02:14.984" end="02:15.469">so</span> <span begin="02:15.469" end="02:15.709">ex</span><span begin="02:15.709" end="02:16.212">ci</span><span begin="02:16.212" end="02:16.586">ted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我变得异常兴奋</span></p><p begin="02:16.586" end="02:18.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="02:16.586" end="02:16.701">When</span> <span begin="02:16.701" end="02:17.006">I</span> <span begin="02:17.006" end="02:17.336">fi</span><span begin="02:17.336" end="02:17.443">nal</span><span begin="02:17.443" end="02:17.721">ly</span> <span begin="02:17.721" end="02:18.234">find</span> <span begin="02:18.234" end="02:18.526">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当我终于找寻到时</span></p><p begin="02:18.712" end="02:22.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="02:18.712" end="02:18.969">It</span> <span begin="02:18.969" end="02:19.359">just</span> <span begin="02:19.359" end="02:19.716">gets</span> <span begin="02:19.716" end="02:20.271">brigh</span><span begin="02:20.271" end="02:20.707">ter</span> <span begin="02:20.707" end="02:21.244">from</span> <span begin="02:21.244" end="02:21.744">now</span> <span begin="02:21.744" end="02:22.519">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那种顿悟之感 自此愈发变得明亮</span></p><p begin="02:23.253" end="02:26.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="02:23.253" end="02:23.498">Then</span> <span begin="02:23.498" end="02:23.975">you</span> <span begin="02:23.975" end="02:26.479">sigh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随后你叹气道</span></p><p begin="02:26.736" end="02:29.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="02:26.736" end="02:26.996">You</span> <span begin="02:26.996" end="02:27.234">know</span> <span begin="02:27.234" end="02:27.753">I</span> <span begin="02:27.753" end="02:28.233">love</span> <span begin="02:28.233" end="02:28.527">you</span> <span begin="02:28.740" end="02:28.840">so</span> <span begin="02:28.840" end="02:29.000">I</span> <span begin="02:29.000" end="02:29.236">think</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知道我爱你 所以我想</span></p><p begin="02:29.236" end="02:31.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="02:29.236" end="02:29.481">I</span> <span begin="02:29.481" end="02:29.741">should</span> <span begin="02:29.741" end="02:30.172">tell</span> <span begin="02:30.172" end="02:30.513">you</span> <span begin="02:30.736" end="02:31.225">Por</span><span begin="02:31.225" end="02:31.458">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我应该告诉你 颇特</span></p><p begin="02:31.458" end="02:38.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="02:31.458" end="02:31.975">This</span> <span begin="02:31.975" end="02:34.586">life</span> <span begin="02:34.743" end="02:35.001">well</span> <span begin="02:35.001" end="02:35.244">i</span><span begin="02:35.244" end="02:35.490">sn’t</span> <span begin="02:35.490" end="02:35.718">it</span> <span begin="02:35.718" end="02:36.499">time</span> <span begin="02:36.499" end="02:36.732">that</span> <span begin="02:36.732" end="02:37.236">you</span> <span begin="02:37.236" end="02:37.727">grow</span> <span begin="02:37.727" end="02:38.141">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">生命至此 你是不是也应该长大了?</span></p><p begin="02:39.243" end="02:41.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="02:39.243" end="02:39.498">Oh</span> <span begin="02:39.498" end="02:39.982">it’s</span> <span begin="02:39.982" end="02:40.736">cal</span><span begin="02:40.736" end="02:41.473">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">噢 那感觉呼唤着我</span></p><p begin="02:41.754" end="02:45.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:41.754" end="02:42.248">I</span> <span begin="02:42.248" end="02:42.511">just</span> <span begin="02:42.511" end="02:42.991">can’t</span> <span begin="02:42.991" end="02:43.479">stop</span> <span begin="02:43.479" end="02:43.983">I’m</span> <span begin="02:43.983" end="02:44.734">sor</span><span begin="02:44.734" end="02:45.463">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只是无法停下 我很抱歉</span></p><p begin="02:45.721" end="02:48.841" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:45.721" end="02:46.229">I</span> <span begin="02:46.229" end="02:46.478">can</span> <span begin="02:46.478" end="02:46.727">feel</span> <span begin="02:46.727" end="02:46.963">a</span> <span begin="02:46.963" end="02:47.481">new</span> <span begin="02:47.481" end="02:47.963">day</span> <span begin="02:47.963" end="02:48.488">daw</span><span begin="02:48.488" end="02:48.841">ning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我能感受到新的一天的黎明降临</span></p><p begin="02:48.242" end="02:50.479" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:48.242" end="02:48.477">I</span> <span begin="02:48.477" end="02:48.994">burn</span> <span begin="02:48.994" end="02:49.329">up</span> <span begin="02:49.497" end="02:49.984">burn</span> <span begin="02:49.984" end="02:50.479">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我熊熊燃烧 燃烧殆尽</span></p><p begin="02:50.971" end="02:54.564" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:50.971" end="02:51.234">I</span> <span begin="02:51.234" end="02:51.474">shoul</span><span begin="02:51.474" end="02:51.737">dn’t</span> <span begin="02:51.737" end="02:52.246">do</span> <span begin="02:52.246" end="02:52.694">this</span> <span begin="02:52.694" end="02:53.248">to</span> <span begin="02:53.248" end="02:53.719">my</span><span begin="02:53.719" end="02:54.564">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我本不应该这样对待自己的</span></p><p begin="02:55.249" end="02:57.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:55.249" end="02:55.507">But</span> <span begin="02:55.507" end="02:55.958">sin</span><span begin="02:55.958" end="02:56.734">cere</span><span begin="02:56.734" end="02:57.444">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但诚恳地</span></p><p begin="02:57.717" end="03:01.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:57.717" end="02:58.233">Can’t</span> <span begin="02:58.233" end="02:58.492">you</span> <span begin="02:58.492" end="02:58.992">feel</span> <span begin="02:58.992" end="02:59.492">what</span> <span begin="02:59.492" end="02:59.968">I’m</span> <span begin="02:59.968" end="03:00.737">fee</span><span begin="03:00.737" end="03:01.269">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道你感受不到我的感觉吗</span></p><p begin="03:01.737" end="03:05.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="03:01.737" end="03:02.219">I</span> <span begin="03:02.219" end="03:02.476">can</span> <span begin="03:02.476" end="03:02.736">see</span> <span begin="03:02.736" end="03:02.989">my</span> <span begin="03:02.989" end="03:03.473">life</span> <span begin="03:03.473" end="03:03.971">so</span> <span begin="03:03.971" end="03:04.709">clear</span><span begin="03:04.709" end="03:05.090">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">生活在我的眼中如此清晰</span></p><p begin="03:04.284" end="03:06.527" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="03:04.284" end="03:04.521">I</span> <span begin="03:04.521" end="03:05.021">burn</span> <span begin="03:05.021" end="03:05.400">up</span> <span begin="03:05.532" end="03:06.032">burn</span> <span begin="03:06.032" end="03:06.527">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我熊熊燃烧 燃烧殆尽</span></p><p begin="03:07.019" end="03:10.584" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="03:07.019" end="03:07.260">I</span> <span begin="03:07.260" end="03:07.524">shoul</span><span begin="03:07.524" end="03:07.784">dn’t</span> <span begin="03:07.784" end="03:08.253">do</span> <span begin="03:08.253" end="03:08.759">this</span> <span begin="03:08.759" end="03:09.291">to</span> <span begin="03:09.291" end="03:09.769">my</span><span begin="03:09.769" end="03:10.584">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我本不应该这样对待自己的</span></p><p begin="03:10.828" end="03:14.729" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:10.828" end="03:11.003">Well</span> <span begin="03:11.003" end="03:11.144">this</span> <span begin="03:11.144" end="03:11.415">is</span> <span begin="03:11.415" end="03:11.650">why</span> <span begin="03:11.650" end="03:11.910">we</span> <span begin="03:11.910" end="03:12.274">do</span> <span begin="03:12.274" end="03:12.782">it</span> <span begin="03:13.295" end="03:13.516">for</span> <span begin="03:13.516" end="03:13.784">the</span> <span begin="03:13.784" end="03:14.274">fee</span><span begin="03:14.274" end="03:14.729">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好吧 这就是我们的缘由 为了那种感觉</span></p><p begin="03:15.036" end="03:16.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="03:15.036" end="03:15.149">How</span> <span begin="03:15.149" end="03:15.389">do</span> <span begin="03:15.389" end="03:15.650">you</span> <span begin="03:15.650" end="03:15.911">do</span> <span begin="03:15.911" end="03:16.294">mu</span><span begin="03:16.294" end="03:16.816">sic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是如何创作音乐的呢</span></p><p begin="03:17.283" end="03:18.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="03:17.283" end="03:17.529">Well</span> <span begin="03:17.529" end="03:17.766">it’s</span> <span begin="03:17.766" end="03:18.284">ea</span><span begin="03:18.284" end="03:18.648">sy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">其实这很简单</span></p><p begin="03:18.648" end="03:20.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="03:18.648" end="03:18.756">You</span> <span begin="03:18.756" end="03:19.011">just</span> <span begin="03:19.011" end="03:19.527">face</span> <span begin="03:19.527" end="03:19.693">your</span> <span begin="03:19.693" end="03:20.263">fears</span> <span begin="03:20.263" end="03:20.656">and</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你只需要面对你的恐惧</span></p><p begin="03:20.656" end="03:22.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:20.656" end="03:20.801">You</span> <span begin="03:20.801" end="03:21.026">be</span><span begin="03:21.026" end="03:21.392">come</span> <span begin="03:21.392" end="03:21.782">your</span> <span begin="03:21.782" end="03:22.236">he</span><span begin="03:22.236" end="03:22.765">roes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随后 成为你自己的英雄</span></p><p begin="03:22.765" end="03:26.482" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:22.765" end="03:23.026">I</span> <span begin="03:23.026" end="03:23.276">don’t</span> <span begin="03:23.276" end="03:23.548">un</span><span begin="03:23.548" end="03:23.789">der</span><span begin="03:23.789" end="03:24.256">stand</span> <span begin="03:24.256" end="03:24.482">why</span> <span begin="03:24.482" end="03:24.742">you’re</span> <span begin="03:24.742" end="03:25.231">frea</span><span begin="03:25.231" end="03:25.742">king</span> <span begin="03:25.742" end="03:26.482">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不理解 为何你会对此感到这般畏惧</span></p><p begin="03:26.718" end="03:27.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:26.718" end="03:27.200">Then</span> <span begin="03:27.200" end="03:27.473">they</span> <span begin="03:27.473" end="03:27.931">say</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随后他们说</span></p><p begin="03:27.931" end="03:32.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:27.931" end="03:30.453">Fine</span> <span begin="03:30.705" end="03:30.967">well</span> <span begin="03:30.967" end="03:31.227">do</span> <span begin="03:31.227" end="03:31.455">what</span> <span begin="03:31.455" end="03:31.716">you</span> <span begin="03:31.716" end="03:32.213">need</span> <span begin="03:32.213" end="03:32.690">to</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好吧 就做你所做吧</span></p><p begin="03:32.690" end="03:34.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:32.690" end="03:32.811">But</span> <span begin="03:32.811" end="03:32.923">I</span> <span begin="03:32.923" end="03:33.208">don’t</span> <span begin="03:33.208" end="03:33.444">want</span> <span begin="03:33.444" end="03:33.698">to</span> <span begin="03:33.698" end="03:34.147">see</span> <span begin="03:34.147" end="03:34.702">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我不想再看到你</span></p><p begin="03:34.702" end="03:38.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:34.702" end="03:35.187">Was</span><span begin="03:35.187" end="03:35.451">ting</span> <span begin="03:35.451" end="03:35.951">your</span> <span begin="03:35.951" end="03:38.725">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">浪费你的生命</span></p><p begin="03:38.725" end="03:42.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:38.725" end="03:38.968">And</span> <span begin="03:38.968" end="03:39.223">i</span><span begin="03:39.223" end="03:39.466">sn’t</span> <span begin="03:39.466" end="03:39.708">it</span> <span begin="03:39.708" end="03:40.476">time</span> <span begin="03:40.476" end="03:40.705">you</span> <span begin="03:40.705" end="03:41.203">get</span> <span begin="03:41.203" end="03:41.673">a</span> <span begin="03:41.673" end="03:42.444">job</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是时候去找一份体面的工作